pseudo-Boolean proof version 3.0
% Regression test: normalizing `-1 x1 >= i64::MAX` flips the term to `1 ~x1` and raises
% the degree to i64::MAX + 1, which used to wrap to i64::MIN and turned the infeasible
% input constraint into a trivially true one. The instance has no solution.
f 1 ;
output NONE;
conclusion SAT : x1 ;
end pseudo-Boolean proof;
